# Files executed inside Linux containers must keep LF line endings, even on a
# Windows checkout with core.autocrlf=true. A CRLF shell script breaks the
# Postgres init hook (`set: pipefail\r: invalid option`), so the Airflow and
# Metabase metadata databases are never created.
* text=auto
*.sh text eol=lf
*.sql text eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
Dockerfile* text eol=lf
Makefile text eol=lf
